=== zh_0452 ===
// source: "A translated copy of designer manuscript\nOur cemetery usually represents a person through an icon of their occupation. This burial is different: the deceased is an <link=\"infant\">infant</link> who had not yet been assigned an occupation. None of the existing designs would do.\n\nThe family asked us not to define the child by work he had never begun. We chose a human figure instead. The child had no occupation, but he was still a person.\n\n\"A child without an occupation is a person before anything else.\""
设计师手稿译文
我们墓园通常用职业图案纪念死者。这次不同。逝者是一名尚未获分配职业的<link="infant">婴儿</link>，旧有的设计一个也不适用。

家属请我们不要用孩子从未开始的工作定义他。于是我们选了一个人形。他没有职业，也依然是一个人。

「没有职业的孩子，首先也是一个人。」
-> DONE

