-> DONE

=== zh_0454 ===
// source: "My student visited me with urgency. She showed me a photo of the actual appearance of the infant. I was stunned as I never saw a dayfolk that was born like this. She asked me to design the tombstone with his real appearance, so that he can truly be remembered. I rejected her, as I have having a commission from the infant's parents, not her. She left with disappointment, and perhaps, a little bit of anger."
我的学生急急忙忙来找我，给我看了一张婴儿真实相貌的照片。我吃了一惊，从没见过生下来是这个样子的昼民。她要我照着孩子原来的模样做墓碑，好让人真的记得他。我拒绝了。委托我的是婴儿的父母，不是她。她失望地走了，也许还有一点生气。
-> DONE

