// source: "The Scholar's Notes on Disappearances"
学者的失踪调查笔记
-> DONE

=== zh_0472 ===
// source: "The unexplained <link=\"disappearance\">disappearances</link> in Day City are always reported at dawn, when people wake.\n\nThe Dayfolk's bodies are unusual. Anyone who fails to enter a sleeping coffin on time will die. Once inside, however, they lose all awareness and ability to act for the entire night, under the coffin's complete protection.\n\nWho has been tampering with their sleeping coffins? I cannot investigate the movements of the Nightfolks while they are awake. I can only suspect that, while taking our food, they have also done something to my husband and my people.\n\nIt is not only disappearances. Many of us, myself included, have found fresh wounds upon waking. Given the Nightfolk's habit of plundering, they are most likely responsible. I must remain vigilant."
昼城不明原因的<link="disappearance">失踪</link>总是在人们醒来的黎明报告。

昼民的身体很特殊。不按时进入睡棺，就会死。可一旦躺进去，整夜都会失去知觉和行动能力，由睡棺全权保护。

是谁动了他们的睡棺？夜民醒着时在做什么，我无从查起。我只能怀疑，他们拿走食物的同时，也对我的丈夫和族人做了什么。

消失并不是唯一的问题。不少人醒来时发现身上多了新伤口，我也一样。夜民素来掠夺，最可能就是他们干的。我得提高警惕。
-> DONE

