// source: "The Scholar, Her Work, and Her Patron"
学者、她的工作与资助人
-> DONE

=== zh_0474 ===
// source: "The record describes a Day City resident who first studied this transparent mineral and discovered the energy within it. She was granted the title of <link=\"scholar\">Scholar</link>.\n\nThe stones were later used to power machinery. The occupational title thus became associated with crystal research.\n\nA young man from a wealthy family was the first to invest in her research. He later became her husband and came to be known as the <link=\"tycoon\">Tycoon</link>.\n\nIn recognition of her outstanding contributions to Day City, the Scholar may apply for a mausoleum beyond the usual grave-marker design and have her family interred within it. For the Dayfolk, who place such importance on the rituals of death, this is the highest honor."
记录说，一名昼城居民最先研究这种透明矿物，发现里面蕴含的能量，于是得到<link="scholar">学者</link>的称号。

后来晶石被用来驱动机械，这个职业称号也因此与晶石研究相连。

第一个投资她研究的是一名富家青年。他后来成了她的丈夫，人称<link="tycoon">大亨</link>。

为表彰她对昼城的卓越贡献，学者可以申请一座规格超出普通墓碑的墓室，将家人一同安葬。昼民看重身后礼仪，这对他们而言是最高荣誉。
-> DONE

