=== zh_0539 ===
// source: "The Skyway is a path cleared upward through fallen stone. It is uneven, but not steep.\n\nSearching for food and water, the Nightfolk dug and climbed in every direction. At last, they opened a route upward through the collapsed ruins.\n\nThe Dayfolk called the day they arrived \"the Day Darkness Descended.\" Much food and many livestock were taken before the Dayfolk even knew who had done it. Eventually, they discovered the passage to Night City.\n\nThe reopened route also led the Dayfolk to the shining stones the Nightfolk had excavated while searching for food and water: crystals that would later power Day City's development.\n\nThe exchange continued with each cycle of day and night. The Dayfolk brought back crystals; the Nightfolk brought back food. Each took what they needed. This balance lasted a long time."
天梯是从落石中向上清出的一条路。路不平，却并不陡。

夜民为了寻找食物和水，朝各个方向挖掘、攀爬，终于穿过坍塌的废墟，打通了一条往上走的路。

昼民把他们抵达那天叫作「黑暗降临之日」。等昼民弄清是谁干的，许多食物和牲畜已经被带走。后来他们找到了通往夜城的通道。

重新打通的路也让昼民看见了夜民为找食物和水挖出的发光石头。那些晶石后来成了昼城发展的能源。

交换随着昼夜交替继续。昼民带回晶石，夜民带回食物，各取所需。这种平衡维持了很久。
-> DONE

