=== zh_0593 ===
// source: "No. There was a cemetery where both peoples were buried together. You will not visit it on this trip. They did not always keep their graves separate, nor their residences. If you learn about cemeteries in human civilization, they are often the microcosm of a city's history of integration and segregation—cemeteries are the diorama of cities."
没有。曾经有一座墓园，同时葬着昼民和夜民。你这趟不会去那里。他们的墓并非一直分开，住宅也是。如果你去了解人类的墓园，会发现它往往缩印了一座城市融合与隔绝的历史。墓园是一座城的微缩景观。
-> DONE

=== zh_0594 ===
// source: "(She lets out a quiet breath and brings the discussion back to the task.)"
（她轻轻吐了口气，把话题拉回了调查。）
-> DONE

