=== zh_0870 ===
// source: "Legend tells of a twin-bodied creature that lived here before Day City was founded. Its two halves looked entirely different: one was covered in fur, with narrow eyes; the other was smooth, with clearly visible eyes.\n\nThen, in a single night, they disappeared.\n\nThe oldest account places the creature here 250 years ago. If it ever walked these grounds, a trace of it might still be found under the searchlight."
传说在昼城建成之前，这里住着一只双体生物。它的两半截然不同：一半覆着皮毛，眼睛狭长；另一半光滑，眼睛清晰可见。

后来，就在一夜之间，它们消失了。

最古老的记载把这只生物放在二百五十年前的这里。如果它真的在这片土地上走过，也许仍能在探照灯下找到它的痕迹。
-> DONE

